      "topic_id": "b97b6037-35b8-41c1-bb2d-a23ca926d9b5",
      "topic_label": "topic_2",
      "text": "This involves verifying mill certificates against the specified S460ML thresholds (yield strength ≥ 460 MPa, CEV ≤ 0.45%) and performing physical checks for surface defects, dimensional tolerances, and flatness.",
